# Remedy divides its 5 prevention: 2 to Hill Giant, 3 to the human player
# (CR 601.2d; DamagePreventEffect.java:105 gives each target a shield of its
# own share). The ai's Lightning Bolt then deals 3 to the Giant: its 2-point
# shield prevents 2 and 1 is marked -- not the whole 5, which would have
# prevented all of it.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 W
tapformana human 3 W
queue targets 4,human
queue divide 2,3
queue paygeneric W
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana ai 10 R
queue targets 4
castspell ai 9
resolvestack
